      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2019-june/q4",
      "question": "<p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x+2}{1} = \\frac{y-5}{-1} = \\frac{z-4}{-3}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{r}\\boldsymbol{\\cdot}(\\mathbf{i}-2\\mathbf{j}+\\mathbf{k}) = -7\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>Determine whether the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> intersects <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> at a single point, or lies in <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span>, or is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> without intersecting it.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
