      "id": "exam/edexcel-8fm0-01-2019-june/q7",
      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z) = z^3 - 8z^2 + pz - 24\"></span></p><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> is a real constant.</p><p>Given that the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z) = 0\"></span> has distinct roots</p><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha, \\beta\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left( \\alpha + \\frac{12}{\\alpha} - \\beta \\right)\"></span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) solve completely the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(z) = 0\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Hence find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
